            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I added a new commit. Would it be an idea to refactor the following  lines that are duplicated in all new tests:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\n  type_keys('i<C-n>')\r\n  eq(is_pumvisible(), true)\r\n  type_keys('<Tab>')\r\n  eq(is_pumvisible(), false)\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nPerhaps a `H.validate_jump_closes_pmenu(key)`",
